{"id": "EUVD-2013-7295", "enisaUuid": "406840a4-4208-3767-8789-3a6b661e3fa2", "description": "ExtUtils::Typemaps::STL::Vector versions before 1.05 for Perl allocate a 32 GiB array on an empty list.\n\nThe OUTPUT typemaps call av_extend( av, len-1 ). On an empty list, this undeflows, and av_extend will allocate an array with 2^32 slots, leading to memory exhaustion.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T12:44:48", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T15:42:48", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://metacpan.org/release/SMUELLER/ExtUtils-Typemaps-Default-1.05/changes", "https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Bug/Display.html?id=91213", "https://github.com/tsee/extutils-typemap-default/commit/0eb696b75afcfedbf87a72e11d44d98110863934.patch"], "aliases": ["CVE-2013-10076", "GHSA-8m2x-x5mf-xm4c"], "assigner": "CPANSec", "epss": 0.38, "enisaIdProduct": [], "enisaIdVendor": [], "isExploited": false}